Z||000011||Dave Gunsul||08-13-2001||01:45 PM||||IRM sells a dual system that eliminates the muffler. If that's to loud then the Fiero store sells a complete system in either stock or performance versions. You probably won't be able to just put a muffler on without changing the whole exhaust because the super traps are probably using a dual pipe like the IRM system.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
