Z||000024||GT-maniac||08-14-2001||01:42 AM||||If you want to try something different you might want to try the custom setup I have. I'm using what I think is a stock muffler but it's positioned where the catalytic converter used to be. From there it runs to the back where it splits into two pipes to exit through the megaphones out the back. It definitely sounds different then the stock setup. A little louder with a great throaty rumble. ||||reg||1
