Z||000026||GT-maniac||08-14-2001||01:19 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85fierogt:<BR><B>what about the cat?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You may be able to toss it in your state, you'd have to ask your local DMV or whoever inspects vehicles where you live.. They're not required where I live and losing the cat is also supposed to improve peformance somewhat. From what I understand the fewer restrictions you have in your exhaust flow the better.<P>||||reg||1
